  shape: cylinder
  tooltip: "ID: context_packet\nResponsibility: Bind task, actor, exact refs, changed files, and checkpoint metadata.\nOwner: Tabellio maintainers\nRuntime: Versioned JSON\nState variables: base_sha; head_sha; merge_base_sha; context_digest\nInvariants: Integrity excludes the self-integrity field from its hash.\nEvidence: intended/design_document: docs/workflow-model.md:1#Tabellio Workflow Model @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca; implemented/source_code: scripts/capture-tabellio-context.mjs:1#context capture @ 979a81d07994f8024c3b071581165de94685d2ca"
}

